WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.310
Have you ever wondered what&nbsp;
SCP-134, the Star-Eyed Child, wants?

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:10.550
Foundation staff used SCP-978, the Desire&nbsp;
Camera, to snap a picture of SCP-134 while&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:14.690
she was reading a braille copy of The&nbsp;
Cat in the Hat. This was the result:

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:18.530
"SCP-134 floating unharmed in the vacuum of space,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:22.430
curled into the fetal position. Its&nbsp;
eyes were closed in the photograph."

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:28.310
Like any child, SCP-134 really just&nbsp;
wants peace, comfort, and safety.

